# Line endings: LF everywhere. Shell scripts (package-plugin.sh,
# dev/screenshots/run.sh) and the bash in the workflows break with CRLF, and
# WordPress.org/SVN should receive the same bytes on every machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary files.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.mo   binary
*.enc  binary

# The plugin ZIP is built from an allow list (package-plugin.sh and the
# release workflow), not from `git archive`, so no export-ignore rules here.
